em; width:6em;text-align:center;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:4px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Norrby_IF\" title=\"Norrby IF\">Norrby</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;z-index:200;top:65.3%; left:19.7%;height:0;width:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;top:-4px;left:-4px;width:8px;text-align:center;line-height:0;z-index:201\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:110%;position:relative;top:-1.5em; left:-6.5em;width:6em;text-align:right;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:3px;left:2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Varbergs_BoIS_FC\" title=\"Varbergs BoIS FC\">Varberg</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;z-index:200;top:54.8%; left:16.7%;height:0;width:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;top:-4px;left:-4px;width:8px;text-align:center;line-height:0;z-index:201\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:110%;position:relative;top:-1.5em; left:-6.5em;width:6em;text-align:right;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:5px;left:2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96rgryte_IS\" title=\"Örgryte IS\">Örgryte</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;z-index:200;top:69.1%; left:46.2%;height:0;width:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;top:-4px;left:-4px;width:8px;text-align:center;line-height:0;z-index:201\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:110%;position:relative;top:-1.5em;left:0.5em;text-align:left;width:6em;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:5px;left:-2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96sters_IF\" title=\"Östers IF\">Öster</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%\">Geografisk placering av de deltagande lagen i Superettan 2018.</div>\n</div>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Lag_och_arenor\">Lag och arenor</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Superettan_2018&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Lag och arenor\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Superettan_2018&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Lag och arenor\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>16 har kvalificerat sig för spel i superettan 2018 efter resultat från <a href=\"/wiki/Fotbollsallsvenskan_2017\" title=\"Fotbollsallsvenskan 2017\">Allsvenskan 2017</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Superettan_2017\" title=\"Superettan 2017\">Superettan 2017</a> och <a href=\"/wiki/Division_1_i_fotboll_f%C3%B6r_herrar_2017\" title=\"Division 1 i fotboll för herrar 2017\">Division 1 2017</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Spelprogrammet fastställdes 21 december 2017.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th width=\"130\">Lag\n</th>\n<th width=\"140\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sveriges_l%C3%A4n\" title=\"Sveriges län\">Län</a>\n</th>\n<th width=\"100\">Ort\n</th>\n<th>Arena\n</th>\n<th>Underlag\n</th>\n<th colspan=\"2\">Kapacitet\n</th>\n<th>Placering<br />2017\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/AFC_Eskilstuna\" title=\"AFC Eskilstuna\">AFC Eskilstuna</a>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/S%C3%B6dermanlands_l%C3%A4n\" title=\"Södermanlands län\"><img alt=\"Södermanlands län\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/55/S%C3%B6dermanlands_vapen.svg/20px-S%C3%B6dermanlands_vapen.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"16\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/55/S%C3%B6dermanlands_vapen.svg/40px-S%C3%B6dermanlands_vapen.svg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"248\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/S%C3%B6dermanlands_l%C3%A4n\" title=\"Södermanlands län\">Södermanland</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Eskilstuna\" title=\"Eskilstuna\">Eskilstuna</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Tunavallen\" title=\"Tunavallen\">Tunavallen</a>\n</td>\n<td>Konstgräs\n</td