>30</td>\n<td> 7  </td>\n<td> 8  </td>\n<td> 15 </td>\n<td> 43 </td>\n<td> 54 </td>\n<td>−11</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">29</td>\n</tr><tr style=\"background:#f0c4c4;\"> <td>15</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gefle_IF_Fotboll\" title=\"Gefle IF Fotboll\">Gefle IF</a>  </td>\n<td>30</td>\n<td> 6  </td>\n<td> 7  </td>\n<td> 17 </td>\n<td> 31 </td>\n<td> 60 </td>\n<td>−29</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">25</td>\n</tr><tr style=\"background:#f0c4c4;\"> <td>16</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Landskrona_BoIS\" title=\"Landskrona BoIS\">Landskrona BoIS</a> <span style=\"cursor:help;color:dimgrey;font-size:0.8em;font-weight:bold;\" title=\"Uppflyttad från föregående säsong\">(U)</span>  </td>\n<td>30</td>\n<td> 5  </td>\n<td> 7  </td>\n<td> 18 </td>\n<td> 35 </td>\n<td> 56 </td>\n<td>−21</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">22</td>\n</tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading4\"><h4 id=\"Uppflyttningskval\">Uppflyttningskval</h4><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Superettan_2018&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Uppflyttningskval\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Superettan_2018&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Uppflyttningskval\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<dl><dd><div class=\"noprint hatnote\"><i>Fördjupning: <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Kvalspelet_till_Fotbollsallsvenskan_2019&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Kvalspelet till Fotbollsallsvenskan 2019 [inte skriven än]\">Kvalspelet till Fotbollsallsvenskan 2019</a></i></div></dd></dl>\n<p>Laget som slutade på 3:e plats, <a href=\"/wiki/AFC_Eskilstuna\" title=\"AFC Eskilstuna\">AFC Eskilstuna</a>, spelar ett kvalspel mot det lag som slutade på 14:e plats i <a href=\"/wiki/Fotbollsallsvenskan_2018\" title=\"Fotbollsallsvenskan 2018\">fotbollsallsvenskan 2018</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/IF_Brommapojkarna\" title=\"IF Brommapojkarna\">IF Brommapojkarna</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-23\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-23\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>23<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0px\" border=\"0\" class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"margin-bottom:4px; width:100%; border-style:none; background-color:transparent;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:3%; font-weight:bold; font-size:0.875em;\" id=\"1\">1</td>\n<td style=\"width:12%; text-align:right; font-weight:normal; font-size:0.9375em;\">22 november 2018</td>\n<td style=\"width:24%; text-align:right; font-weight:bold; font-size:1em;;\"><a href=\"/wiki/AFC_Eskilstuna\" title=\"AFC Eskilstuna\">AFC Eskilstuna</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:12%; text-align:center; font-weight:bold; font-size:1em;\">\n<a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Kvalspelet_till_Fotbollsallsvenskan_2019&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Kvalspelet till Fotbollsallsvenskan 2019 [inte skriven än]\">0 – 1</a></td>\n\n<td style=\"width:24%; text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:1em;;\"><a href=\"/wiki/IF_Brommapojkarna\" title=\"IF Brommapojkarna\">IF Brommapojkarna</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:21%; text-align:left; font-size:0.875em;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tunavallen\" title=\"Tunavallen\">Tunavallen</a></td>\n<th style=\"width:4%; font-size:0.9375em;\"></th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:right; font-size:0.9375em;\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">19:00&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Koordinerad_universell_tid\" title=\"Koordinerad universell tid\">UTC+1</a><br /></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:right; font-size:0.875em;\"></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:center; font-size:0.875em;\">(0 – 1)<br /><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www2.svenskfotboll.se/cuper-och-serier/information/?scr=result&amp;fmid=4104290\">Rapport</a></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:left; font-size:0.875em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/M%C3%A5l_(sport)\" title=\"Mål\"><img alt=\"Mål\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Soccerball_shade.svg/20px-Soccerball_shade.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Soccerball_shade.svg/40px-Soccerball_shade.svg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"333\" data-file-height=\"333\" /></a></span>&#160;<span style=\"font-size:10px;vertical-align:middle;\">12&#8242;</span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jack_Lahne\" title=\"Jack Lahne\">Jack Lahne</a><br /></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:left; font-size:0.875em;\" rowspan=\"3\" colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eskilstuna\" title=\"Eskilstuna\">Eskilstuna</a><br />Publik: 3&#160;465<br />Domare: <a href=\"/wiki/Stefan_Johannesson\" title=\"Stefan Johannesson\">Stefan Johannesson</a><br /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:center; font-size:0.90em;\" colspan=\"3\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:right; font-size:0.875em;\"></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:center; font-size:0.9375em;\"></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:left; font-size:0.875em;\"></td>\n</tr></tbody></table>\n<hr />\n<table cellspacing=\"0px\" border=\"0\" class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"margin-bottom:4px; width:100%; border-style:none; background-color:transparent;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:3%; font-weight:bold; font-size:0.875em;\" id=\"2\">2</td>\n<td style=\"width:12%; text-align:right; font-weight:normal; font-size:0.9375em;\">25 november 2018</td>\n<td style=\"width:24%; text-align:right; font-weight:bold; font-size:1em;;\"><a href=\"/wiki/IF_Brommapojkarna\" title=\"IF Brommapojkarna\">IF Br