kipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Soccerball_shade.svg/20px-Soccerball_shade.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Soccerball_shade.svg/40px-Soccerball_shade.svg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"333\" data-file-height=\"333\" /></a></span>&#160;<span style=\"font-size:10px;vertical-align:middle;\">65&#8242;</span> <a href=\"/wiki/Samuel_Nnamani\" title=\"Samuel Nnamani\">Samuel Nnamani</a><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/M%C3%A5l_(sport)\" title=\"Mål\"><img alt=\"Mål\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Soccerball_shade.svg/20px-Soccerball_shade.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Soccerball_shade.svg/40px-Soccerball_shade.svg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"333\" data-file-height=\"333\" /></a></span>&#160;<span style=\"font-size:10px;vertical-align:middle;\">75&#8242;</span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bajram_Ajeti\" title=\"Bajram Ajeti\">Bajram Ajeti</a><br /></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:left; font-size:0.875em;\" rowspan=\"3\" colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stockholm\" title=\"Stockholm\">Stockholm</a><br />Publik: 1&#160;925<br />Domare: <a href=\"/wiki/Andreas_Ekberg\" title=\"Andreas Ekberg\">Andreas Ekberg</a><br /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:center; font-size:0.90em;\" colspan=\"3\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:right; font-size:0.875em;\"></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:center; font-size:0.9375em;\"></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:left; font-size:0.875em;\"></td>\n</tr></tbody></table>\n<p><i>AFC Eskilstuna kvalificerade sig för <a href=\"/wiki/Fotbollsallsvenskan_2019\" title=\"Fotbollsallsvenskan 2019\">Allsvenskan 2019</a> enligt <a href=\"/wiki/Bortam%C3%A5lsregeln\" title=\"Bortamålsregeln\">bortamålsregeln</a>.</i>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading4\"><h4 id=\"Nedflyttningskval\">Nedflyttningskval</h4><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Superettan_2018&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Nedflyttningskval\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Superettan_2018&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Nedflyttningskval\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>Laget som slutade på 14:e plats, <a href=\"/wiki/Varbergs_BoIS\" title=\"Varbergs BoIS\">Varbergs BoIS</a>, i superettan spelar ett kvalspel mot det lag som slutade på 2:a plats i <a href=\"/wiki/Division_1_i_fotboll_f%C3%B6r_herrar_2018\" title=\"Division 1 i fotboll för herrar 2018\">division 1 södra</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Oskarshamns_AIK\" title=\"Oskarshamns AIK\">Oskarshamns AIK</a>. Laget som slutade på 13:e plats i superettan, <a href=\"/wiki/IFK_V%C3%A4rnamo\" title=\"IFK Värnamo\">IFK Värnamo</a>, spelar ett kvalspel mot det lag som slutade på 2:a plats i <a href=\"/wiki/Division_1_i_fotboll_f%C3%B6r_herrar_2018\" title=\"Division 1 i fotboll för herrar 2018\">division 1 norra</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Syrianska_FC\" title=\"Syrianska FC\">Syrianska FC</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-24\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-24\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>24<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0px\" border=\"0\" class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"margin-bottom:4px; width:100%; border-style:none; background-color:transparent;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:3%; font-weight:bold; font-size:0.875em;\" id=\"1\">1</td>\n<td style=\"width:12%; text-align:right; font-weight:normal; font-size:0.9375em;\">14 november 2018</td>\n<td style=\"width:24%; text-align:right; font-weight:bold; font-size:1em;;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Syrianska_FC\" title=\"Syrianska FC\">Syrianska FC</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:12%; text-align:center; font-weight:bold; font-size:1em;\">\n1 – 0</td>\n\n<td style=\"width:24%; text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:1em;;\"><a href=\"/wiki/IFK_V%C3%A4rnamo\" title=\"IFK Värnamo\">IFK Värnamo</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:21%; text-align:left; font-size:0.875em;\"><a href=\"/wiki/S%C3%B6dert%C3%A4lje_Fotbollsarena\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Södertälje Fotbollsarena\">Södertälje Fotbollsarena</a></td>\n<th style=\"width:4%; font-size:0.9375em;\"></th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:right; font-size:0.9375em;\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">19:00&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Koordinerad_universell_tid\" title=\"Koordinerad universell tid\">UTC+1</a><br /></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:right; font-size:0.875em;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Seth_Hellberg\" title=\"Seth Hellberg\">Seth Hellberg</a> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/M%C3%A5l_(sport)\" title=\"Mål\"><img alt=\"Mål\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Soccerball_shade.svg/20px-Soccerball_shade.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Soccerball_shade.svg/40px-Soccerball_shade.svg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"333\" data-file-height=\"333\" /></a></span>&#160;<span style=\"font-size:10px;vertical-align:middle;\">48&#8242;&#160;(<a href=\"/wiki/Straffspark\" title=\"Straffspark\">str.</a>)</span><br /></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:center; font-size:0.875em;\">(0 – 0)<br /><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www2.svenskfotboll.se/cuper-och-serier/matcher-idag/?scr=result&amp;fmid=4104302\">Rapport</a></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:left; font-size:0.875em;\"></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:left; font-size:0.87