\" /></a></span>&#160;<span style=\"font-size:10px;vertical-align:middle;\">45+1&#8242;</span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sebastian_Rajalakso\" title=\"Sebastian Rajalakso\">Sebastian Rajalakso</a><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/M%C3%A5l_(sport)\" title=\"Mål\"><img alt=\"Mål\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Soccerball_shade.svg/20px-Soccerball_shade.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Soccerball_shade.svg/40px-Soccerball_shade.svg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"333\" data-file-height=\"333\" /></a></span>&#160;<span style=\"font-size:10px;vertical-align:middle;\">90+1&#8242;</span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mathias_Ran%C3%A9gie\" title=\"Mathias Ranégie\">Mathias Ranégie</a><br /></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:left; font-size:0.875em;\" rowspan=\"3\" colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/V%C3%A4rnamo\" title=\"Värnamo\">Värnamo</a><br />Publik: 1&#160;526<br />Domare: <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Victor_Wolf&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Victor Wolf [inte skriven än]\">Victor Wolf</a><br /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:center; font-size:0.90em;\" colspan=\"3\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:right; font-size:0.875em;\"></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:center; font-size:0.9375em;\"></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:left; font-size:0.875em;\"></td>\n</tr></tbody></table>\n<p><i>Syrianska FC kvalificerade sig för <a href=\"/wiki/Superettan_2019\" title=\"Superettan 2019\">Superettan 2019</a> med ackumulerade slutresultatet 3–2.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<table cellspacing=\"0px\" border=\"0\" class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"margin-bottom:4px; width:100%; border-style:none; background-color:transparent;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:3%; font-weight:bold; font-size:0.875em;\" id=\"1\">1</td>\n<td style=\"wi